---
import { community, giscusEnabled } from '../config/community';
---
<section class="comments" aria-labelledby="comments-title">
  <div class="section-heading compact-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">DISCUSSION</p><h2 id="comments-title">活动讨论</h2></div>
  </div>
  {giscusEnabled ? (
    <script
      is:inline
      src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
      data-repo={community.giscus.repo}
      data-repo-id={community.giscus.repoId}
      data-category={community.giscus.category}
      data-category-id={community.giscus.categoryId}
      data-mapping="pathname"
      data-strict="1"
      data-reactions-enabled="1"
      data-emit-metadata="0"
      data-input-position="top"
      data-theme="light"
      data-lang="zh-CN"
      data-loading="lazy"
      crossorigin="anonymous"
      async
    ></script>
  ) : (
    <div class="notice-box">
      <p><strong>活动讨论入口正在配置。</strong></p>
      <p>GitHub Discussions 和 giscus 启用后，本期页面会自动显示评论区，网站其他功能不受影响。</p>
      {community.discussionsUrl && <a class="text-link" href={community.discussionsUrl}>前往 GitHub Discussions →</a>}
    </div>
  )}
</section>
